              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mundu ukamlowua mruna wa waka, uvalo ni ndee, angu uvalo ni mae na kulala nawo, ni ilagho ja waya nandighi, wichainjwa wandunyi, angu walala na mruna wa waka, nao uchaduka wuwiwi ghwake moni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
