          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mndungi wa womi angu wa waka, ukakaia mlaghui olola njama kwa roho ra wandu wifue, angu ukakaia msawi, wichabwaghwa kwa kulaswa na magho, weekushekeria kufwa weni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
